# Keep the Docker build context lean (infra/Dockerfile.dashboard builds from
# the repo root — vps-dokploy-nextjs skill, dockerfile-patterns.md). Excluding
# .env* also keeps secrets out of the build context even by accident.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.git
.github
.claude
docs
history
specs
carousel-routine
packages/remotion
media
tools
venv
.venv
*.tsbuildinfo
